/cloudflare-tunnel.json
# Dated backups made when rotating the tunnel. Untracked-but-not-ignored
# is the dangerous state in a public repo: one `git add -A` publishes a
# TunnelSecret permanently, and untracking it afterwards does not
# unpublish it.
/cloudflare-tunnel.json.*
/auth0.json
/github-deploy.key
/github-deploy.key.pub
/github-push-token.txt
